## Template demonstration only

Use this example to show a configurable offering when the buyer needs a clear requirements discussion rather than a fixed model number. Replace the copy with verified scope, constraints, documentation, and real imagery before the public site is launched.

## Information to collect

Add the buyer application, the real configuration choices, what is included, and any verified technical or commercial conditions. Do not add prices, certifications, lead times, or performance claims unless the customer has supplied current evidence.
